# The @3x renders. Produced by tools/wallet_art and deliberately not committed:
# nothing ships them.
#
# A .pkpass carries @1x and @2x only -- these are photographic gradients, which
# PNG compresses badly, and all three scales together come to about 900KB per
# card against 340KB for two. An @3x device upscaling an @2x gradient by half is
# a difference nobody can see; the wait on mobile data is one they can.
#
# The tool still makes them, so shipping them later is a one-line change in
# wallet_apple.js rather than a re-render.
*@3x.png
